    <unit id="DurationDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Duration can be used to specify how long the notification stays open. After the duration time elapses, the notification closes automatically. If not specified, default value is 4.5 seconds. If you set the value to TimeSpan.Zero, the notification box will never close automatically.</source>
        <target state="translated">Duration 可指定通知保持打开的时间。时间结束后通知会自动关闭。未指定时默认值为 4.5 秒；设置为 TimeSpan.Zero 时通知不会自动关闭。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="DurationTitle">
